      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Stand Up and Eat"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小乐邀请保罗去她家吃饭。",
      "traditional": "小樂邀請保羅去她家吃飯。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè yāo qǐng bǎo luó qù tā jiā chī fàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "小乐的妈妈做了很多菜，还有她的拿手菜——饺子。",
      "traditional": "小樂的媽媽做了很多菜，還有她的拿手菜——餃子。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè de mā ma zuò le hěn duō cài hái yǒu tā de ná shǒu cài jiǎo zi",
      "english": "Little Le invited Paul to her home for dinner."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "大家一边吃饭一边聊天，非常开心。",
      "traditional": "大家一邊吃飯一邊聊天，非常開心。",
      "pinyin": "dà jiā yì biān chī fàn yì biān liáo tiān fēi cháng kāi xīn",
      "english": "Little Le’s mom made many dishes, including her specialty – dumplings."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "饺子出锅了，小乐的妈妈对保罗说：“保罗，你蘸着吃！”",
      "traditional": "餃子出鍋了，小樂的媽媽對保羅說：“保羅，你蘸著吃！”",
      "pinyin": "jiǎo zi chū guō le xiǎo lè de mā ma duì bǎo luó shuō bǎo luó nǐ zhàn zhe chī",
      "english": "They all happily ate while chatting."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "保罗觉得很奇怪，他心想：“为什么要站着吃饺子呢？”",
      "traditional": "保羅覺得很奇怪，他心想：“為什麼要站著吃餃子呢？”",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó jué de hěn qí guài tā xīn xiǎng wèi shén me yào zhàn zhe chī jiǎo zi ne",
      "english": "When the dumplings were ready, Little Le’s mom said to Paul: “Paul, dip it and eat!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "虽然不明白为什么，为了表示礼貌，保罗还是站了起来。",
      "traditional": "雖然不明白為什麼，為了表示禮貌，保羅還是站了起來。",
      "pinyin": "suī rán bù míng bai wèi shén me wèi le biǎo shì lǐ mào bǎo luó hái shi zhàn le qǐ lai",
      "english": "Paul was confused, thinking to himself: “Why should I stand up and eat dumplings?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小乐一家人全都哈哈大笑起来。",
      "traditional": "小樂一家人全都哈哈大笑起來。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè yì jiā rén quán dōu hā hā dà xiào qǐ lái",
      "english": "Even though he didn’t understand why, Paul still stood up to show courtesy."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "小乐说：“保罗，我妈妈是让你蘸着醋吃，不是让你站起来吃！”",
      "traditional": "小樂說：“保羅，我媽媽是讓你蘸著醋吃，不是讓你站起來吃！”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè shuō bǎo luó wǒ mā ma shì ràng nǐ zhàn zhe cù chī bú shì ràng nǐ zhàn qǐ lai chī",
      "english": "Little Le’s family all started laughing loudly."
    }
  ],
