    "sentence_translations": [
      "Stand Up and Eat",
      "",
      "Little Le invited Paul to her home for dinner.",
      "Little Le’s mom made many dishes, including her specialty – dumplings.",
      "They all happily ate while chatting.",
      "When the dumplings were ready, Little Le’s mom said to Paul: “Paul, dip it and eat!”",
      "Paul was confused, thinking to himself: “Why should I stand up and eat dumplings?”",
      "Even though he didn’t understand why, Paul still stood up to show courtesy.",
      "Little Le’s family all started laughing loudly.",
      "Little Le said: “Paul, my mom is asking you to dip it into the vinegar, not to stand up and eat!”"
    ]
